  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/567/501/unknown.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/743/107/new-project.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"352\"><br></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/uJRh2EV.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"376\" height=\"126\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/567/501/unknown.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"28\"></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><strong>關於：</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">這個模組在 Minecraft 中加入了名為「水豚」的叢林生物！你可以用甘蔗來馴服牠們，並用蘋果來繁殖！不過牠們只會在叢林中生成，而且非常稀有。</span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><br></span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/567/501/unknown.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"28\"></p>",
